      "rdfs:label": "InvestmentThesis",
      "rdfs:comment": "An investment or strategic thesis — a structured argument for a particular approach to building (e.g. Service-as-Software, Agent, Headless SaaS). Stackable: one Thesis composes a Solution from primitives at lower-layer Theses. Named `InvestmentThesis` (not `Thesis`) to avoid collision with schema:Thesis (academic dissertation).",
